# Trihybrid cross

@body

- Given a genotype of
  - Ss Yy Aa.
- What are the possible gametes?
- 8 possibilities
  - (2 alleles, 3 genes → 23 = 8)
  - [S]{color=red}[Y]{color=blue}A, [S]{color=red}[y]{color=blue}a, [S]{color=red}yA, [S]{color=red}ya, s[Y]{color=blue}A, s[Y]{color=blue}a, syA, sya
- How big is the Punnett Square for the trihybrid cross?
  - Ss Yy Aa × Ss Yy Aa

